<title>USA: Massachusetts $200 mln GO bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>Massachusetts $200 mln GO bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>THE COMMONWEALTH OF MASSACHUSETTS</p>
<p>RE: $200,000,000</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>CONSOLIDATED LOAN OF 1996, SERIES C</p>
<p>THE BALANCE OF THE BONDS HAVE TRADED AT LIST.</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE NOW FREE TO TRADE.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>State Street Bank and Trust Company</p>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>Tucker Anthony Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
